        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>小学语文阅读理解答题技巧18条</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: #f2f4f0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  .header {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 52px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg,#8fd6f5 0%, #6ec6f0 55%, #f7a8c8 100%);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding-left: 46px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .header .mascot {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 6px;\n    top: 6px;\n    width: 38px;\n    height: 38px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #fff8e6;\n    border: 2px solid #ffd9a0;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #b08a55;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .header h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.12);\n  }\n  .header h1 .yellow { color: #fff45e; }\n\n  /* ---------- Right index tabs ---------- */\n  .tabs {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 52px;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 26px;\n    bottom: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n  .tabs span {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    color: #9a9a9a;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff;\n  }\n  .tabs span:nth-child(1){background:#eaf6e2}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(2){background:#f6f0dc}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(3){background:#f7e6de}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(4){background:#f7dede}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(5){background:#f6dcea}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(6){background:#ece0f2}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(7){background:#dde2f4}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(8){background:#dceef4}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(9){background:#dcf0ea}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(10){background:#e6f2da}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(11){background:#f2f2d8}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(12){background:#f6ece0}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(13){background:#f6dfe2}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(14){background:#f0dfee}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(15){background:#e2e2f2}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(16){background:#dceaf2}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(17){background:#dff0e8}\n  .tabs span:nth-child(18){background:#eef2dc}\n\n  /* ---------- Content ---------- */\n  .sheet {\n    position: relative;\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    margin: 8px 32px 10px 10px;\n    padding: 10px 12px 14px;\n    border: 1px solid #cfe6d8;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(180,205,220,.28) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(180,205,220,.28) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 18px 18px;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n\n  /* rainbow watermark placeholder */\n  .placeholder.rainbow {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 130px;\n    top: 300px;\n    width: 250px;\n    height: 220px;\n    border: 1px dashed #d9d9d9;\n    color: #c8c8c8;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 100%, rgba(255,220,120,.20), rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%);\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n\n  p, .line {\n    margin: 0 0 4px;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 1.62;\n    color: #333;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 3;\n  }\n  .title-plain {\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .num {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 17px;\n    height: 17px;\n    line-height: 17px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin-right: 4px;\n    vertical-align: 2px;\n  }\n  .n1 { background: #f4a52a; }\n  .n2 { background: #f3792f; }\n  .n3 { background: #33bcd6; }\n  .n4 { background: #3fa9f5; }\n  .n5 { background: #8e7cd8; }\n\n  .orange { color: #e8791f; }\n  .purple { color: #8a5fd0; }\n  .teal   { color: #1a9e9e; }\n  .green  { color: #3aa03a; }\n\n  .leaf::before {\n    content: \"❁\";\n    color: #4caf50;\n    margin-right: 4px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .sec {\n    margin: 8px 0 5px;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    color: #8a5fd0;\n  }\n  .sec .chk {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    background: #4caf50;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 16px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n    vertical-align: 2px;\n  }\n  .sec .hl {\n    background: #efe6fb;\n    padding: 1px 4px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n  }\n  .indent { text-indent: 0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"mascot\">[图标]</div>\n    <h1><span>小学语文</span><span class=\"yellow\">阅读理解答题技巧18条</span></h1>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"tabs\">\n    <span>01</span><span>02</span><span>03</span><span>04</span><span>05</span>\n    <span>06</span><span>07</span><span>08</span><span>09</span><span>10</span>\n    <span>11</span><span>12</span><span>13</span><span>14</span><span>15</span>\n    <span>16</span><span>17</span><span>18</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sheet\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder rainbow\">[装饰插图：彩虹与云朵，页面中部背景]</div>\n\n    <p class=\"title-plain\">答题方式：</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"num n1\">1</span>不能，用了“××”词，生动地说明了……，能够激发读者的兴趣，去掉就没有这种效果。</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"num n2\">2</span>不能，删掉“××”词，句子的意思就变成了……，显得太绝对化；用了“××”词，准确地说明了……，符合实际情况，留有余地，具有科学性。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"leaf\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">赏析句段从几方面考虑：</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"num n1\">1</span><span class=\"orange\">内容：</span>写了什么，选材有什么独特之处</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"num n2\">2</span><span class=\"orange\">形式：</span>写作方法，语言特色</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"num n3\">3</span><span class=\"teal\">修辞：</span>①比喻：生动形象 ②拟人：形象生动 ③张：突出特征 ④排比：加强语气 ⑤反问：态度鲜明，增强语气</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"num n4\">4</span><span class=\"teal\">感情：</span>文章的社会价值，意义，作用等</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"num n5\">5</span><span class=\"purple\">结构：</span>在全文中的作用</p>\n\n    <div class=\"sec\"><span class=\"chk\">✔</span><span class=\"hl\">10.景物描写的作用</span></div>\n    <p>交代故事发生的时间、地点；渲染气氛，烘托人物心情；表现人物性格；推动情节的发展。</p>\n\n    <div class=\"sec\"><span class=\"chk\">✔</span><span class=\"hl\">11.记叙的顺序：</span><span style=\"color:#333;\">顺叙，倒叙，插叙</span><span class=\"purple\">（补叙属于插叙的一种）</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"sec\"><span class=\"chk\">✔</span><span class=\"hl\">12.写作人称的好处</span></div>\n\n    <p><span class=\"num n1\">1</span>第一人称：<span class=\"orange\">真实可信</span></p>\n    <p><span class=\"num n2\">2</span>第二人称：<span class=\"orange\">亲切自然</span></p>\n    <p><span class=\"num n3\">3</span>第三人称：<span class=\"teal\">可以多角度描写，不受时间和空间的限制。</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
